# A member of a class under a computed key may be an accessor under any name, so a store that may create a field has no typed form on objects of that class, nor on a set of layouts that they are among.
# The guess about `this` tests for the classes whose members all have names, and the objects of the other class go through the store as written.
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all-ParameterGuards
# CHECK: ShapeTest v0 layouts=[L0]
# CHECK: PutSlotOrAdd {{*}} key="a" receivers=[L0]
